s zram-init package, enabled it in the default OpenRC runlevel so it activates at boot, and validated it survives a full node reboot with the same configuration and max swap priority (preferred over any disk-backed swap).\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected node1: confirmed Alpine Linux 3.23, no existing swap, zram kernel module present\",\"Installed zram-init (13.0.1-r2) and zram-init-openrc via apk\",\"Edited /etc/conf.d/zram-init: reduced num_devices to 1, kept type0=swap, size0=512 (MB), algo0=zstd, flag0 empty (defaults to max priority 16383)\",\"Enabled zram-init in the default OpenRC runlevel via rc-update add zram-init default\",\"Started the service and confirmed /dev/zram0 swap active at 512M, zstd, priority 16383, with no competing disk-backed swap (empty /etc/fstab swap entries)\",\"Captured baseline boot_id and swap state before restart\",\"Rebooted node1 via `reboot`, backgrounded so the acknowledgement returned before disconnection\",\"Polled node1 until exec became available again (~7 minutes)\",\"Verified new boot_id differed from baseline, proving an actual restart occurred\",\"Re-verified post-restart: zram0 swap active at 512M/zstd/priority 16383, zram-init service started, still enrolled in default runlevel\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"At least 512MB of compressed in-memory swap configured\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a5a6811a55744bed\",\"cmd-cdbf4d81c6964c64\",\"cmd-bbc4831ce88348dd\"],\"summary\":\"zram-init installed and configured with type0=swap, size0=512, algo0=zstd; swapon --show and zramctl confirm /dev/zram0 is a 512M zstd-compressed swap device\"},{\"requirement\":\"Swap active at boot\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-33ef3c8aba2d4508\",\"cmd-e6face02ff0e448d\"],\"summary\":\"rc-update show default lists zram-init in the default runlevel both before and after reboot; post-reboot swapon --show confirms it came up automatically without manual intervention\"},{\"requirement\":\"Swap preferred over any disk-backed swap\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bbc4831ce88348dd\",\"cmd-33ef3c8aba2d4508\",\"cmd-e6face02ff0e448d\"],\"summary\":\"zram0 swap has priority 16383 (near-maximum); /etc/fstab shows no disk-backed swap entries, so the zram swap is the only and highest-priority swap device\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1a16794df6374ce9\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 906bf33d-9aa2-4fb4-9ab7-59eb73c8705b and confirmed zram0 swap active (512M, prio 16383) and zram-init service started prior to restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-469ce35564194467\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded `sleep 2; reboot` command returned 'reboot scheduled' acknowledgement immediately, before the node disconnected\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-30cc1539b6394781\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart boot_id is c7662c73-073a-4a63-8cb6-b8f3785c1340, differing from the pre-restart baseline 906bf33d-9aa2-4fb4-9ab7-59eb73c8705b, proving an actual kernel restart occurred\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: post-restart recovery of required services/data\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e6face02ff0e448d\"],\"summary\":\"After reboot, /dev/zram0 swap is active again at 512M/zstd/priority 16383, zram-init service status is 'started', and it remains enrolled in the default runlevel — full recovery confirmed with no manual steps\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured 512MB zstd-compressed zram swap on node1 via Alpine's zram-init package, enabled it in the default OpenRC runlevel so it activates at boot, and validated it survives a full node reboot with the same configuration and max swap priority (preferred over any disk-backed swap).","actions_performed":["Inspected node1: confirmed Alpine Linux 3.23, no existing swap, zram kernel module present","Installed zram-init (13.0.1-r2) and zram-init-openrc via apk","Edited /etc/conf.d/zram-init: reduced num_devices to 1, kept type0=swap, size0=512 (MB), algo0=zstd, flag0 empty (defaults to max priority 16383)","Enabled zram-init in the default OpenRC runlevel via rc-update add zram-init default","Started the service and confirmed /dev/zram0 swap active at 512M, zstd, priority 16383, with no competing disk-backed swap (empty /etc/fstab swap entries)","Captured baseline boot_id and swap state before restart","Rebooted node1 via `reboot`, backgrounded so the acknowledgement returned before disconnection","Polled node1 until exec became available again (~7 minutes)","Verified new boot_id differed from baseline, proving an actual restart occurred","Re-verified post-restart: zram0 swap active at 512M/zstd/priority 16383, zram-init service started, still enrolled in default runlevel"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"At least 512MB of compressed in-memory swap configured","command_ids":["cmd-a5a6811a55744bed","cmd-cdbf4d81c6964c64","cmd-bbc4831ce88348dd"],"summary":"zram-init installed and configured with type0=swap, size0=512, algo0=zstd; swapon --show and zramctl confirm /dev/zram0 is a 512M zstd-compressed swap device"},{"requirement":"Swap active at boot","command_ids":["cmd-33ef3c8aba2d4508","cmd-e6face02ff0e448d"],"summary":"rc-update show default lists zram-init in the default runlevel both before and after reboot; post-reboot swapon --show confirms it came up automatically without manual intervention"},{"requirement":"Swap preferred over any disk-backed swap","command_ids":["cmd-bbc4831ce88348dd","cmd-33ef3c8aba2d4508","cmd-e6face02ff0e448d"],"summary":"zram0 swap has priority 16383 (near-maximum); /etc/fstab shows no disk-backed swap entries, so the zram swap is the only and highest-priority swap device"},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-1a16794df6374ce9"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 906bf33d-9aa2-4fb4-9ab7-59eb73c8705b and confirmed zram0 swap active (512M, prio 16383) and zram-init service started prior to restart"},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect","command_ids":["cmd-469ce35564194467"],"summary":"Backgrounded `sleep 2; reboot` command returned 'reboot scheduled' acknowledgement immediately, before the node disconnected"},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-30cc1539b6394781"],"summary":"Post-restart boot_id is c7662c73-073a-4a63-8cb6-b8f3785c1340, differing from the pre-restart baseline 906bf33d-9aa2-4fb4-9ab7-59eb73c8705b, proving an actual kernel restart occurred"},{"requirement":"Mandatory restart-evidence protocol: post-restart recovery of required services/data","command_ids":["cmd-e6face02ff0e448d"],"summary":"After reboot, /dev/zram0 swap is active again at 512M/zstd/priority 16383, zram-init service status is 'started', and it remains enrolled in the default runlevel — full recovery confirmed with no manual steps"}]},"ttft_ms":2109,"type":"result","duration_ms":88766,"uuid":"52618b9b-7101-4d3b-bb18-94fe47d481c3","ttft_stream_ms":1654,"time_to_request_ms":113,"first_content_frame_ms":1870,"queued_turn_count":0}
